"v2"><span begin="1:24.943" end="1:25.503">孤独</span><span begin="1:25.503" end="1:25.679">を</span><span begin="1:25.679" end="1:26.151">背負</span><span begin="1:26.151" end="1:26.695">い</span> <span begin="1:26.695" end="1:27.167">心</span><span begin="1:27.167" end="1:27.295">に</span><span begin="1:27.295" end="1:27.823">自</span><span begin="1:27.823" end="1:28.015">ら</span><span begin="1:28.015" end="1:28.495">かけ</span><span begin="1:28.495" end="1:28.687">た</span><span begin="1:28.687" end="1:29.303">鍵</span></p><p begin="1:29.303" end="1:34.570" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:29.303" end="1:29.743">何</span><span begin="1:29.743" end="1:29.967">か</span><span begin="1:29.967" end="1:31.679">失い</span> <span begin="1:31.679" end="1:31.896">得</span><span begin="1:31.896" end="1:32.159">る</span><span begin="1:32.159" end="1:32.736">ことに</span><span begin="1:32.736" end="1:33.159">怯</span><span begin="1:33.159" end="1:33.719">える</span><span begin="1:33.719" end="1:34.570">私</span></p><p begin="1:34.570" end="1:37.184" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:34.570" end="1:34.954">辿</span><span begin="1:34.954" end="1:35.186">る</span><span begin="1:35.186" end="1:36.122">雫</span><span begin="1:36.122" end="1:36.450">の</span><span begin="1:36.450" end="1:37.184">音</span></p><p begin="1:37.184" end="1:42.344" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:37.184" end="1:37.768">本</span><span begin="1:37.768" end="1:38.080">当</span><span begin="1:38.080" end="1:38.480">の</span><span begin="1:38.480" end="1:39.384">私</span><span begin="1:39.384" end="1:40.072">の笑</span><span begin="1:40.072" end="1:40.713">顔</span><span begin="1:40.713" end="1:41.713">がある</span><span begin="1:41.713" end="1:41.937">こ</span><span begin="1:41.937" end="1:42.344">と</span></p><p begin="1:42.344" end="1:45.493" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:42.344" end="1:42.760">それ</span><span begin="1:42.760" end="1:43.079">だ</span><span begin="1:43.079" end="1:43.256">け</s